From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 11:57:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fixup! logging: add reproducible reviewed C++ AST conversion
 tool

Keep the SQLite custom-field support adjustment limited to appending DatabaseVersion and ErrorCode. Preserve all existing registry source lines and field IDs instead of reindenting the whole macro. Catalog source-preservation check exits1 before and0 after; tracked AST tool tests pass. Catalog repair only, no daemon source or functional claim in this fixup. Earlier frozen formatting candidate receipt is preserved separately and will not be attributed to the corrected minimal consumer.
